# COMPUTED EXAMPLE TRANSCRIPTS.
#
# Generated by `just examples` (go/cmd/hew-examples) from the scenarios in
# examples/, by actually running the hew CLI. They are not committed: a
# transcript on disk is a claim about how the CLI behaves, and a committed one
# can be stale. Generating them at build time means the site cannot publish a
# transcript that this commit's binary does not produce.
src/content/docs/examples/
